## Next Recommended Step

For the stable authoring phase order, Phase 2 deterministic recipe planning now
has a handoff record in
`Docs/Analysis/controlrig_stable_authoring_phase2_handoff.md`. Continue from
that boundary instead of treating this Phase 1 handoff as approval for live
asset mutation.

For the later AnimBP binding proof track, when Unreal Editor and the UE 5.6.1
UnrealMCP bridge are already listening on `127.0.0.1:55561`, capture the
optional live proof:

```powershell
uv --directory .\Python run python scripts\analysis\smoke_controlrig_stable_input_golden_candidate_bridge.py --require-bridge --json > Docs\Analysis\ControlRigStableInputGolden\stable_input_candidate_live_proof.json
```

Then run the promotion checker and update only the evidence and manual decision
records after review. Do not patch
`Docs/Research/fixtures/controlrig_piper_stable_animbp_binding_contract.json`
until the live proof, manual approval, and manual patch plan all pass.
